f the heart is situated in the- ", "option1": "Posteroinferior part of the interatrial septum ", "option2": "Anterior part of the atrioventricular septum ", "option3": "Upper part of the sulcus terminalis ", "option4": "Upper part of interventricular septum ", "answer": "1", "exp": "<img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/mceu_475504489441750370311015.jpg\" />"}, {"id": "27", "question": "২৭) Origin of the external carotid artery lies at the level of- ", "option1": "Lower border of C6 vertebra", "option2": "Upper border of thyroid cartilage ", "option3": "Upper border of cricoid cartilage ", "option4": "Thyroid isthmus ", "answer": "2", "exp": "<img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/mceu_614049946431750370540200.png\" />"}, {"id": "28", "question": "২৮) Which of the followings is not a part of the upper respiratory tract? ", "option1": "Nasal cavity ", "option2": "Nasopharynx ", "option3": "Oropharynx ", "option4": "Larynx ", "answer": "4", "exp": "<img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/mceu_486775440431750370910600.jpg\" />"}, {"id": "29", "question": "২৯) Terminal bronchioles-", "option1": "Are part of the respiratory zone ", "option2": "Have goblet cells ", "option3": "Are lined by pseudostratified ciliated columnar epithelium ", "option4": "Have no hyaline cartilage ", "answer": "4", "exp": "<img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/mceu_634408165431750371406235.png\" />"}, {"id": "30", "question": "৩০) Superior meatus of the nose receives the opening of- ", "option1": "Posterior ethmoidal sinus", "option2": "Maxillary sinus ", "option3": "Anterior ethmoidal sinus ", "option4": "Nasolacrimal duct ", "answer": "1", "exp": "<img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.ama